Time to take the lead!

267
00:13:34,380 --> 00:13:38,830
No one is marking Tsubasa-kun in front of the goal!

268
00:13:41,340 --> 00:13:42,460
Tsubasa-kun!

269
00:13:42,460 --> 00:13:45,890
Will Misaki-kun's long pass reach him?

270
00:13:45,890 --> 00:13:46,970
It reached him!

271
00:13:46,970 --> 00:13:50,090
No one is marking Tsubasa-kun in front of the goal!

272
00:13:50,090 --> 00:13:52,560
Take this!

273
00:13:52,560 --> 00:13:54,420
Goal!

274
00:13:54,420 --> 00:13:55,250
I did it!

275
00:13:55,250 --> 00:13:57,310
Nankatsu reverses the score in the blink of an eye.

276
00:13:57,840 --> 00:13:59,810
It's being celebrated joyfully!

277
00:13:59,810 --> 00:14:01,220
Tsubasa!

278
00:14:01,220 --> 00:14:02,740
You did it!

279
00:14:05,610 --> 00:14:06,880
W-What is this?

280
00:14:06,880 --> 00:14:09,730
The assistant referee raises his flag.

281
00:14:09,730 --> 00:14:11,500
There's an offside!

282
00:14:11,500 --> 00:14:12,150
What?!

283
00:14:12,150 --> 00:14:13,100
Offside?!

284
00:14:15,060 --> 00:14:16,760
Offside.

285
00:14:16,760 --> 00:14:21,800
When the attacking side passes to a teammate in the opponent's half...

286
00:14:21,800 --> 00:14:27,740
...and there are fewer than two players in front of the goal, including the goalkeeper, it's an offside.

287
00:14:27,740 --> 00:14:36,140
And the offside trap relies on using this rule to leave the opposing player alone in an offside position.

288
00:14:36,140 --> 00:14:40,690
Is Musashi an expert at the offside trap?!

289
00:14:42,550 --> 00:14:43,230
Taki-kun!

290
00:14:44,150 --> 00:14:45,900
Alright! This time...

291
00:14:46,340 --> 00:14:48,150
Again, no one is marking Tsubasa-kun.

292
00:14:51,110 --> 00:14:52,110
Alright!

293
00:14:55,090 --> 00:14:57,760
Offside again!

294
00:14:57,760 --> 00:14:59,760
This is the offside trap.

295
00:14:59,760 --> 00:15:01,620
Just as I thought! I was right!

296
00:15:01,620 --> 00:15:03,380
Damn it!

297
00:15:03,380 --> 00:15:08,260
Thanks to the repeated offside traps, Tsubasa's shooting was being prevented.

298
00:15:12,640 --> 00:15:13,800
Offside!

299
00:15:13,800 --> 00:15:17,250
Tsubasa-kun can't do anything!

300
00:15:17,250 --> 00:15:21,440
Things seemed to have reached an impasse for the Nankatsu eleven.

301
00:15:21,440 --> 00:15:24,090
Advance while Nankatsu is disorganized!

302
00:15:24,090 --> 00:15:24,690
Let's go!

303
00:15:24,690 --> 00:15:26,060
Okay!

304
00:15:26,060 --> 00:15:28,190
This time Musashi is attacking!

305
00:15:28,190 --> 00:15:29,030
Honma!

306
00:15:29,990 --> 00:15:31,700
The ball goes to the right wing!

307
00:15:31,700 --> 00:15:34,200
Sanada-kun runs towards the goal!

308
00:15:39,020 --> 00:15:41,080
The ball is my friend.

309
00:15:41,080 --> 00:15:44,420
I'm not afraid. But it hurts a lot.

310
00:15:44,420 --> 00:15:46,670
Alright! It'll happen on the 3rd try!

311
00:15:47,980 --> 00:15:49,800
