315
00:15:59,480 --> 00:16:02,440
You're not the only one who can take that shot.

316
00:16:06,540 --> 00:16:07,360
This...

317
00:16:07,360 --> 00:16:09,580
W-What is this?!

318
00:16:09,580 --> 00:16:13,280
This time Misugi-kun performs an amazing overhead kick!

319
00:16:17,640 --> 00:16:19,740
It shakes the net!

320
00:16:20,790 --> 00:16:23,440
Musashi takes the lead again!

321
00:16:25,120 --> 00:16:27,320
The match is completely under Musashi's...

322
00:16:27,320 --> 00:16:30,300
No, under Misugi-kun's control!

323
00:16:31,000 --> 00:16:33,300
And the whistle to end the first half blows!

324
00:16:33,300 --> 00:16:38,930
The match is 2-1. Musashi finishes the first half ahead.

325
00:16:39,450 --> 00:16:41,310
S-So strong.

326
00:16:42,010 --> 00:16:43,810
Everyone, you did a great job.

327
00:16:43,810 --> 00:16:46,370
Keep it up in the second half too.

328
00:16:46,370 --> 00:16:47,310
Okay.

329
00:16:47,940 --> 00:16:49,520
Are you okay, Misugi?

330
00:16:49,520 --> 00:16:52,090
Yes, I can continue like this in the second half too.

331
00:16:52,090 --> 00:16:53,070
I see.

332
00:16:53,070 --> 00:16:55,070
Manager, can we talk for a moment?

333
00:16:55,070 --> 00:16:57,070
O-Okay.

334
00:16:57,070 --> 00:16:59,080
What's wrong, everyone?

335
00:16:59,080 --> 00:17:01,390
You're not as energetic as usual.

336
00:17:01,390 --> 00:17:06,320
Coach, Misugi's Musashi is really a tough nut.

337
00:17:06,320 --> 00:17:09,840
It's like he has eyes in the back of his head.

338
00:17:09,840 --> 00:17:14,800
It's true that Misugi is one of those prodigy players that come once every few years.

339
00:17:14,800 --> 00:17:17,340
But football is a team game.

340
00:17:17,340 --> 00:17:20,680
Our team play is second to none.

341
00:17:20,680 --> 00:17:22,230
Right, Tsubasa?

342
00:17:22,230 --> 00:17:24,890
What? Yes.

343
00:17:24,890 --> 00:17:27,850
But Misugi-kun is very strong.

344
00:17:28,600 --> 00:17:29,610
Tsubasa!

345
00:17:29,610 --> 00:17:31,610
What's wrong, Tsubasa? You too?

346
00:17:31,610 --> 00:17:32,610
Tsubasa-kun...

347
00:17:34,240 --> 00:17:36,530
He's playing much more technically than me.

348
00:17:38,640 --> 00:17:43,880
He's also better than me at directing his team as captain.

349
00:17:43,880 --> 00:17:48,420
Moreover, there's the obstacle of his heart condition.

350
00:17:49,050 --> 00:17:51,450
I really can't win.

351
00:17:51,450 --> 00:17:53,420
I really can't win.

352
00:17:54,280 --> 00:17:57,380
So, what did you want to talk about, Captain?

353
00:18:02,690 --> 00:18:03,970
What?

354
00:18:04,980 --> 00:18:08,420
Why did you tell Tsubasa-kun about my heart condition?

355
00:18:10,900 --> 00:18:17,020
Because of you, our battle was interrupted twice.

356
00:18:18,740 --> 00:18:21,910
After you coincidentally learned about my heart condition...

357
00:18:21,910 --> 00:18:24,910
...you were always concerned about me.

358
00:18:25,410 --> 00:18:29,240
But this match is a battle between Tsubasa-kun and me.

359
00:18:29,240 --> 00:18:31,170
You have no right to interfere!

360
00:18:33,880 --> 00:18:36,660
I'm sorry, Captain!

361
00:18:45,060 --> 00:18:47,210
What's wrong, Anego?

362
00:18:47,210 --> 00:18:50,370
We'll definitely take the lead in the second half.

363
00:18:50,370 --> 00:18:51,100
No.

364
